### Step 2: Open the New Build Run

When you commit changes, GitHub automatically starts a fresh build with the new code:

1. Tap the **Actions** tab at the top of your repository[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span).
2. Do not re-run build **#1**. In your screenshot, there is already a newer run labeled **Latest #2** at the top right.
3. Tap on the newest workflow run at the very top of the list[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span).
4. It will run through `Install Node Dependencies` and proceed to generate your APK file[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span).
